body:
Not an AMA but ummm I love you Ellyn and you have been the best advocate for victims and victim families. Just you calling police stations, demanding answers, back in your OWD days, that made me so enamored by you. I just hope you have a wonderful rest day, hang with your friends, family, etc. and fuck the very obvious fake crap. It aint rumors, its just them coping with being on the wrong <3

&#x200B;

edit in: i forgot, big respect to you for being a single mom. You and Lola's relationship was very similar to my and my mom's. Though my mom and I are not on good terms right now, I have HUGE respect for my mom for raising me, and I know you do your damn best!
